\begin{enumerate}
\item $F$ is left Kan extended from $(\mathrm{Ring}^{\mathrm{nu,h}}_R)_{\Sigma} \subset \mathrm{Ring}^{\mathrm{nu,h}}_R$. 
\item Whenever $I_\bullet$ is a simplicial object in $\mathrm{Ring}^{\mathrm{nu,h}}_R$ whose geometric
